            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a medical implant comprising an implant body comprising a polymer material, said implant body having a bone-facing interface and an articulating interface, wherein a stiffening layer is provided over at least a portion of the bone-facing interface, and wherein the stiffening layer comprises a mesh formed of a polymer.</p>
